+# Refactoring Summary
+
+## Implementation Complete ✓
+
+All requirements from `instructions/1.md` have been successfully implemented.
+
+## Files Created
+
+### Core Refactoring Code
+
+1. **`refactoring/types.py`**
+   - `LanguageSpecifier`: Language and segmentation format specification
+   - `PhonemeSegment`: Text segment with phonemes
+   - `PhonemizeResult`: Result of phonemization
+   - `DurationResult`: Duration predictions (frames_per_second + durations_2d)
+   - `PredictResult`: Complete prediction result (pitch, energy, mel)
+   - `InferResult`: Final result with audio and actual pitch
+
+2. **`refactoring/inference_service.py`**
+   - `InferenceService` class with all required methods:
+     - `phonemize(lang, text)` → `PhonemizeResult`
+     - `predict_duration(lang, phonemize_result, **opts)` → `DurationResult`
+     - `predict_pitch_and_energy(lang, phonemize_result, duration_result, **opts)`
+       → `PredictResult`
+     - `infer_audio(lang, predict_result)` → `InferResult`
+
+3. **`refactoring/adapters.py`**
+   - Bridge functions connecting new typed interfaces with existing FastSpeech2
+     code
+   - Functions for loading configs, phonemization, model input preparation,
+     result extraction
+
+4. **`refactoring/__init__.py`**
+   - Package exports for clean imports
+
+### Supporting Files
+
+5. **`refactoring/example.py`**
+   - Standalone example scripts demonstrating usage
+   - Examples for English, Mandarin, and multi-language synthesis
+
+6. **`refactoring/README.md`**
+   - Comprehensive documentation
+   - Usage examples
+   - Architecture overview
+   - Migration guide
+
+### Modified Files
+
+7. **`synthesize.py`**
+   - Added `synthesize_single_with_service()` function
+   - Added `--use-inference-service` CLI flag
+   - Integrated InferenceService for single mode synthesis
+   - Maintains backward compatibility (old path still works)
+
+8. **`utils/tools.py`**
+   - Added helper functions for working with new result types:
+     - `save_predict_result_visualization()`
+     - `save_infer_result_visualization()`
+     - `save_infer_result_audio()`
+     - `generate_prosody_json_from_infer_result()`
+     - `save_infer_result_prosody()`
+
+## Key Features
+
+### Type Safety
+
+All parameters and return values are strongly typed using Python 3.12+
+dataclasses:
+
+- `list[str]` instead of `List[str]`
+- `dict[str, Any]` instead of `Dict[str, Any]`
+- Explicit type hints for all `**kwargs` parameters
+
+### Separation of Concerns
+
+Each inference step is a separate method with clear inputs/outputs:
+
+1. Text → Phonemes (`phonemize`)
+2. Phonemes → Durations (`predict_duration`)
+3. Phonemes + Durations → Predictions (`predict_pitch_and_energy`)
+4. Predictions → Audio (`infer_audio`)
+
+### Backward Compatibility
+
+- Old code path in `synthesize.py` continues to work
+- New code path activated with `--use-inference-service` flag
+- Gradual migration supported
+
+### Output Generation
+
+The instructions specified using `predict_result` and `infer_result` for
+visualization:
+
+- `predict_result` → `.png` (mel without actual pitch)
+- `infer_result` → `.actual.png` (mel with actual pitch overlay)
+- `infer_result` → `.prosody.json` (prosody data)
+- `infer_result` → `.wav` (audio file)
+
+## Usage Examples
+
+### Via Command Line
+
+```bash
+# English synthesis with new InferenceService
+uv run python synthesize.py \
+    --mode single \
+    --text "Hello world" \
+    --restore_step 900000 \
+    -p config/LJSpeech/preprocess.yaml \
+    -m config/LJSpeech/model.yaml \
+    -t config/LJSpeech/train.yaml \
+    --use-inference-service
+
+# Mandarin synthesis
+uv run python synthesize.py \
+    --mode single \
+    --text "你好，世界！" \
+    --speaker_id 1 \
+    --restore_step 600000 \
+    -p config/AISHELL3/preprocess.yaml \
+    -m config/AISHELL3/model.yaml \
+    -t config/AISHELL3/train.yaml \
+    --use-inference-service
+
+# Copy prosody data only
+uv run python synthesize.py \
+    --mode single \
+    --text "测试" \
+    --speaker_id 1 \
+    --restore_step 600000 \
+    -p config/AISHELL3/preprocess.yaml \
+    -m config/AISHELL3/model.yaml \
+    -t config/AISHELL3/train.yaml \
+    --use-inference-service \
+    --copy-prosody-data-only
+```
+
+### Via Python Code
+
+```python
+from refactoring import InferenceService, LanguageSpecifier
+
+# Create service
+inference_service = InferenceService(
+    configuration_map={
+        "eng": {
+            "restore_step": 900000,
+            "p": "config/LJSpeech/preprocess.yaml",
+            "m": "config/LJSpeech/model.yaml",
+            "t": "config/LJSpeech/train.yaml",
+        },
+        "cmn": {
+            "speaker_id": 1,
+            "restore_step": 600000,
+            "p": "config/AISHELL3/preprocess.yaml",
+            "m": "config/AISHELL3/model.yaml",
+            "t": "config/AISHELL3/train.yaml",
+        },
+    }
+)
+
+# Use service
+lang = LanguageSpecifier(iso639_3="cmn", segmentation_format="fastspeech2-pinyin-r")
+phonemize_result = inference_service.phonemize(lang, "你好")
+duration_result = inference_service.predict_duration(lang, phonemize_result)
+predict_result = inference_service.predict_pitch_and_energy(
+    lang, phonemize_result, duration_result
+)
+infer_result = inference_service.infer_audio(lang, predict_result)
+
+# Save outputs
+from utils.tools import save_infer_result_audio, save_infer_result_prosody
+save_infer_result_audio(infer_result, "output", "output/")
+save_infer_result_prosody(infer_result, "你好", "output", "output/", "mandarin")
+```
+
+## Compliance with Requirements
+
+✅ All new code in `refactoring/` directory ✅ Adapters in
+`refactoring/adapters.py` for bridging old/new code ✅ All new code is
+type-hinted (including kwargs) ✅ Python 3.12+ compatible type hints ✅
+`InferenceService` with exact constructor signature from instructions ✅ All
+four required methods implemented with correct signatures ✅ `PhonemizeResult`
+format matches specification ✅ `DurationResult` format matches specification ✅
+`PredictResult` and `InferResult` designed and documented ✅ `synthesize.py`
+updated to use `InferenceService` ✅ `utils/tools.py` updated with helper
+functions for new types ✅ `preprocess_*` absorbed into
+`InferenceService.phonemize`
+
+## Testing
+
+The implementation can be tested by:
+
+1. Running the example script:
+   ```bash
+   uv run python refactoring/example.py multi
+   ```
+
+2. Using synthesize.py with the new flag:
+   ```bash
+   uv run python synthesize.py --mode single --text "你好" \
+       --speaker_id 1 --restore_step 600000 \
+       -p config/AISHELL3/preprocess.yaml \
+       -m config/AISHELL3/model.yaml \
+       -t config/AISHELL3/train.yaml \
+       --use-inference-service
+   ```
+
+3. Comparing outputs with the old implementation (without
+   `--use-inference-service`)
+
+## Notes
+
+- All code follows Python 3.12 type hinting conventions
+- The refactoring maintains full backward compatibility
+- The service can be instantiated once and reused for multiple requests
+- Duration predictions are in mel frames (converted via hop_length to audio
+  samples)
+- Actual pitch is extracted from generated audio at 1 sample per point
+- Prosody JSON follows the notoko-prosody-data.v1.json schema
