+## RULES
+
+- You should put new codes related to `InferenceService` under the folder
+  `refactoring`.
+- You can write code in `refactoring/adapters.py` to bridge code in and out of
+  the refactoring.
+- new code under `refactoring` should be type hinted, including kwargs.
+- we are using python 12 and uv.
+
+## REQUIREMENTS
+
+### `InferenceService`
+
+create a class `InferenceService`, that can be contructed as:
+
+```py3
+inference_service = InferenceService(
+  configurationMap={
+    "eng": {
+      "restore_step": 900000,
+      "p": "config/LJSpeech/preprocess.yaml",
+      "m": "config/LJSpeech/model.yaml",
+      "t": "config/LJSpeech/train.yaml",
+    },
+    "cmn": {
+      "speaker_id": 1,
+      "restore_step": 600000,
+      "p": "config/AISHELL3/preprocess.yaml",
+      "m": "config/AISHELL3/model.yaml",
+      "t": "config/AISHELL3/train.yaml",
+    },
+  },
+)
+```
+
+For example, you can construct `InferenceService` based on the cli arguments in
+`synthesize.py`, and then pass the service to `synth_samples`.
+
+#### `InferenceService.phonemize`
+
+````py3
+def phonemize(self, lang: LanguageSpecifier, text: str):
+  """
+  `lang` looks like (dataclasses):
+  - `{"iso639-3": "eng", "segmentation_format": "librispeech"}`
+  - `{"iso639-3": "cmn", "segmentation_format": "fastspeech2-pinyin-r"}`
+
+  returns something like (dataclasses):
+  ```
+  {
+    "segments": [
+      { "text": "你", "phonemes": ["n", "i3"] },
+      { "text": "好", "phonemes": ["h", "ao3"] },
+      { "text": "，", "phonemes": ["sp"] },
+      { "text": "世", "phonemes": ["sh", "iii4"] },
+      { "text": "界", "phonemes": ["j", "ie4"] }
+    ]
+  }
+  ```
+  """
+  pass
+````
+
+#### `InferenceService.predict_duration`
+
+````py3
+def predict_duration(self, lang, phonemize_result, **opts):
+  """
+  - `opts.duration_control`: …
+
+  returns something like (dataclasses):
+  ```
+  {
+    "framesPerSecond": 22050, # not hardcoded.
+    # maps to segments-phonemes.
+    "durations2d": [[123, 456], [789, 234], [567], [891, 345], [678, 912]],
+  }
+  ```
+  """
+  pass
+````
+
+#### `InferenceService.predict_pitch_and_energy`
+
+```py3
+def predict_pitch_and_energy(self, lang, phonemize_result, duration_result, **opts):
+  """
+  - `opts.pitch_control`: …
+  - `opts.energy_control`: …
+
+  You design the return type. we will refer it as `predict_result`.
+  """
+  pass
+```
+
+#### `InferenceService.infer_audio`
+
+```py3
+def infer_audio(self, lang, predict_result):
+  """
+  You design the return type. we will refer it as `infer_result`.
+  """
+  pass
+```
+
+### in `utils/tools.py`
+
+We use `predict_result` to generate the mel graph without the actual pitch line
+(`….png`), and `infer_result` to generate the mel graph with the actual pitch
+line (`….actual.png`).
+
+We use `infer_result` to generate `.prosody.json`.
+
+### in `synthesize.py`
+
+`preprocess_*` are absorbed into `InferenceService.phonemize`.
